#ASSERT `s 133(1) the body is a local authority` `s 133(1) the Common Council of the City of London in its capacity as a local authority` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 133(1) the body is a local authority` `s 133(1) the Council of the Isles of Scilly` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 133(1) the body is a local authority` `s 133(1) a county or county borough council in Wales` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 133(1) the body is a local authority` `s 133(1) a council constituted under section 2 of the Local Government etc. (Scotland) Act 1994` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 133(1) the body is a local authority` `s 133(1) some other body` EQUALS FALSE
